  <text xml:lang="grc"><body xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.tympanistai.dindorf1893-grc1"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.tympanistai.dindorf1893-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_tympanistai"><head>ΤΥΜΠΑΝΙΣΤΑΙ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="563" xml:id="fragment-tympanistai-dindorf1893_grc1-563" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_tympanistai" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.tympanistai.nauck1889grc1:579">
            <note type="source">Stobæus LIX, 12.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Φεῦ φεῦ, τί τούτου χάρμα μεῖζον ἂν λάβοις</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">τοῦ γῆς ἐπιψαύσαντα κἆθ᾽ ὑπὸ στέγῃ</l>
              <l n="3" xml:lang="grc">πυκνῆς ἀκοῦσαι ψακάδος εὑδούσῃ φρενί;</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="commentary">V. 1. affert Plutarchus Vitar. p. 255 c. V. 2. Cicero ad Atticum II, 7. <quote>Cupio istorum naufragia ex terra intueri: cupio, ut ait tuus amicus Sophocles, κἂν ὑπὸ στέγῃ πυκνῆς ἀκούειν ψεκάδος εὑδούσῃ φρενί.</quote></note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="564" xml:id="fragment-tympanistai-dindorf1893_grc1-564" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_tympanistai" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.tympanistai.nauck1889grc1:581">
            <note type="source">Stephanus in Χαλδαίοι.</note>
            <note type="commentary">—Εἰσὶ δὲ Χαλδαῖοι ἔθνος πλησίον τῆς Κολχίδος. Σ. Τυμπανισταῖς</note>
            <quote>Κόλχος τε Χαλδαῖός τε καὶ Σύρων ἔθνος.</quote>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="565" xml:id="fragment-tympanistai-dindorf1893_grc1-565" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_tympanistai">
            <note type="source">Scholiasta Sophoclis Antig. v. 980.</note>
            <note type="commentary">Φινεὺς –μετὰ τὸν Κλεοπάτρας θάνατον ἐπέγημεν Ἰδαίαν τὴν Δαρδάνου, κατὰ δέ τινας Εἰδοθέαν τὴν Κάδμου ἀδελφὴν, ἧς καὶ αὐτὸς Σοφοκλῆς μνημονεύει ἐν Τυμπανισταῖς.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="566" xml:id="fragment-tympanistai-dindorf1893_grc1-566" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_tympanistai" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.tympanistai.nauck1889grc1:582">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, ἄδημον: οὐκ ἔνδημον ὄντα. Σ. Τυμπανισταῖς.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="567" xml:id="fragment-tympanistai-dindorf1893_grc1-567" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_tympanistai" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.tympanistai.nauck1889grc1:583">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἀνετῶς: ἀνατεταμένως. Σ. Τυμπανισταῖς.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="568" xml:id="fragment-tympanistai-dindorf1893_grc1-568" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_tympanistai" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.tympanistai.nauck1889grc1:584">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἀντιστρέφω: ἀνταξιῶ. Σ. Τυμπανισταῖς.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="569" xml:id="fragment-tympanistai-dindorf1893_grc1-569" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_tympanistai" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.tympanistai.nauck1889grc1:585">
            <note type="source">Etymolog. Μ. p. 287, 14.</note>
            <note type="commentary">Δράκαυλος: Σ. Τυμπανισταῖς. ἐπεὶ ἡ Ἀθηνᾶ δοκεῖ παρ᾿ αὐταῖς αὐλίσαι τὸν δράκοντα ταῖς Κέκροπος θυγατράσιν. ἢ ὅτι συναυλίζονται κατὰ τὸ εἰκὸς Κέκροπι ὄντι διφυεῖ. ἢ ὅτι συναυλίζεται μία τῷ ἐν τῇ ἀκροπόλει δράκοντι, προσημερεύουσα τῇ θεῷ. Conf. Hesychium et Suidam.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="570" xml:id="fragment-tympanistai-dindorf1893_grc1-570" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_tympanistai" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.tympanistai.nauck1889grc1:586">
            <note type="source">Ἔλυμοι αὐλοί: vide fragm. 398.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="571" xml:id="fragment-tympanistai-dindorf1893_grc1-571" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_tympanistai" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.tympanistai.nauck1889grc1:580">
            <note type="source">Herodianus περὶ μονήρους λέξεως p. 9, 9.</note>
            <note type="commentary">Σαρπηδὼν πέτρα παρὰ Σοφοκλεῖ ἐν Τυμπανισταῖς</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">῾Ἡμεῖς δ᾽ ἐν ἄντροις, ἔνθα Σαρπηδὼν πέτρα.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
        </div></body></text></TEI>
